-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), §60 (part יג, שונות): the agreement — its
-- section on whom it covers, and its being made for the upper divisions,
-- above all — is no consent to any binding definition of a separate
-- bargaining unit within post-primary education (grades 7 to 14), and no
-- waiver of any claim on the organisation's representativeness in it.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`

§ `60`

-- ¶1: two things the agreement is not, whatever its scope (§2) says.
@ref akn:art_60/p1
`the Oz agreement consents to a separate bargaining unit in post-primary education` MEANS FALSE

`the Oz agreement waives a claim on the organisation's representativeness` MEANS FALSE

#ASSERT NOT `the Oz agreement consents to a separate bargaining unit in post-primary education`
#ASSERT NOT `the Oz agreement waives a claim on the organisation's representativeness`
